Diagnosis:
The regression from XStream 1.4.15 to 1.4.14-java7 involves the removal of critical components:
1. `Base64JavaUtilCodec` - Entire class was removed, including its Base64 encoding/decoding functionality
2. `LambdaMapper` - Entire class was removed, which handled lambda expression serialization

These removals align with the java7 backport nature of 1.4.14-java7, as both Base64 utility (introduced in Java 8) and lambda support would be incompatible with Java 7.

