```markdown
Diagnosis:
The regression appears to be a major backward-incompatible change in Spring validation framework between 3.0.0.RELEASE and 2.5.6.SEC01. Key changes include removal of generic type information from validation collections (List/Set/Map), removal of conversion service support, and removal of auto-growth features - all of which would break modern Spring applications expecting these features.

Selected Hunks:
1. `version-diff/api-diffs/org/springframework/validation/AbstractBindingResult.diff`
```diff
